WEBVTT

c01
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.740 line:73%
Bakit hindi umaabot sa
rated watts ang panels mo?

c02
00:00:03.090 --> 00:00:05.960 line:73%
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

c03
00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:10.930 line:73%
Ang rating ay galing sa lab
test: standard test conditions.

c04
00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:17.360 line:73%
1000 W/m² na liwanag at
25°C na cell temperature.

c05
00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:20.840 line:73%
Sa totoong bubong,
mas mainit ang panels,

c06
00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:24.280 line:73%
at kapag mas mainit,
bumababa ang output.

c07
00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:28.610 line:73%
May epekto rin ang anino,
alikabok, at anggulo ng araw.

c08
00:00:28.910 --> 00:00:32.460 line:73%
Kaya normal na mas mababa
ang aktwal kaysa rating.

cz1
00:00:32.860 --> 00:00:38.850 line:73%
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

cz2
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:41.380 line:73%
Life is SoLight with Solar.
